Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Casimir Optimization Mathematica 9 All Figures", "Title"],

Cell["\<\
Keep this launcher in the same folder as \
Casimir_Optimization_Mathematica9_Final.m. Evaluate the three input cells in \
order. RunStudy[] displays manuscript Figures 2 through 7 inline and also \
saves each one as a PDF in figures_mathematica9_final.\
\>", "Text",
